{"full":"hf:Viggle/viggle-animate","spaceId":"Viggle/viggle-animate","name":"Viggle-Animate","source":"huggingface","description":"Put the person from a still into a driving video, in 4 steps","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":82,"created":"2026-09-01T01:57:37.000Z","updated":"2026-09-09T15:07:18.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://viggle-viggle-animate.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Viggle/viggle-animate","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:31:25.297Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T02:31:25.297Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T02:31:25.297Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🕺","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Upload a driving video and a character still. The clip's first frame is repainted with gpt-image-2 so it shows your character in that exact pose and framing, and that repainted frame is the only conditioning the model gets besides the clip itself — no pose estimation, no segmentation, no masks.","Takes 4–10 s of driving video and renders it at 4 sampling steps; anything longer is cut to 10.1 s. The model itself only renders frame counts of the form 17k+5 and never fewer than 124 (5.17 s), so shorter clips are held out to 124 frames with a frozen last frame and the render is trimmed back — what comes out is exactly as long as what went in.","No sign-in. The GPU comes out of your own ZeroGPU quota, and the render asks for more of it than a free account's day holds — in practice rendering needs PRO. The repaint calls an image model this Space pays for, on the CPU, before any GPU is involved, and is limited to five a day per visitor. The finished examples at the bottom of the page need neither, and are there so the model can be judged for free."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Viggle/viggle-animate/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a1dd456d9c46c8c7b2a458e5c599012945069a6f03255f1e103b6ae7b35ccf26","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T01:02:50.581Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:31:25.370Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Upload a driving video and a character still. The clip's first frame is repainted with gpt-image-2 so it shows your character in that exact pose and framing, and that repainted frame is the only conditioning the model gets besides the clip itself — no pose estimation, no segmentation, no masks.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Viggle/viggle-animate/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The GPU comes out of your own ZeroGPU quota, and the render asks for more of it than a free account's day holds — in practice rendering needs PRO.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Viggle/viggle-animate/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"ZeroGPU xlarge (96 GB) is required — large is 48 GB and cannot hold it. xlarge bills at 2× the normal quota rate, so a free account's day does not go far here; PRO gets 40 min.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Viggle/viggle-animate/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"a1dd456d9c46c8c7b2a458e5c599012945069a6f03255f1e103b6ae7b35ccf26","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Viggle/viggle-animate/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:31:25.370Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-09T15:07:18.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Viggle/viggle-animate/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:31:25.370Z","hash":"a1dd456d9c46c8c7b2a458e5c599012945069a6f03255f1e103b6ae7b35ccf26","originalBytes":2902,"storedBytes":2902,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["frame","model","weights","gpu","renders","after","clip","cpu","day","driving","out","pack","quota","render","video","viggle-animate","what","zerogpu","account","boot","cannot","card","character","comes","does","first","frames","free","fr